    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABOMINATION OPS. A cinematic sci-fi visual novel with explosive action, psychological tension, twisted lore, and bleak humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For years, hidden alien overlords pushed humanity to the brink of madness. Turning the modern world into a hostile pressure cooker, they even twisted our genetics to create hybrid abominations meant to serve as their enforcers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We uncovered the plot. We fought the aliens, we won, and they fled. But they left their hybrid children behind\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abomination Ops is a bleak, high-intensity visual novel about the abandoned hybrids\u2014mutated, hated, barely human. Rejected by society, yet drafted into humanity\u2019s dirtiest black ops missions. Their crime? BEING BORN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a visceral story of survival, identity, and post-alien collapse, brought to life with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intense, cinematic soundtrack blending synthwave, death metal, and shoegaze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish AI-assisted art and animated cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting world that merges dystopian sci-fi with early 1900s aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by one human, many machines, and no committee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story that could not have been made before now.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABOMINATION OPS. A cinematic sci-fi visual novel with explosive action, psychological tension, twisted lore, and bleak humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For years, hidden alien overlords pushed humanity to the brink of madness. Turning the modern world into a hostile pressure cooker, they even twisted our genetics to create hybrid abominations meant to serve as their enforcers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We uncovered the plot. We fought the aliens, we won, and they fled. But they left their hybrid children behind\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abomination Ops is a bleak, high-intensity visual novel about the abandoned hybrids\u2014mutated, hated, barely human. Rejected by society, yet drafted into humanity\u2019s dirtiest black ops missions. Their crime? BEING BORN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a visceral story of survival, identity, and post-alien collapse, brought to life with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intense, cinematic soundtrack blending synthwave, death metal, and shoegaze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish AI-assisted art and animated cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting world that merges dystopian sci-fi with early 1900s aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by one human, many machines, and no committee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story that could not have been made before now.</p>",
